Third-party Python packages are not vendored here. They are installed from their
own distributions under their own licences; the pinned set is in requirements.txt
and requirements-archive.txt.

Chain records, incident registries and third-party status-page data are obtained
from the sources listed in docs/data_provenance.md and remain subject to those
providers' terms. Copyrighted literature PDFs collected while reading are not part
of this repository and are excluded from every export.
